Parity simms are in two variant. there are some that try to fake parity.
i.e. based on data present in the SIMMs during read operation, parity is
calculated & reported. and other are what is known as true parity also known
as 36bit simms. go for 36bit simms & they should work just fine. 4mb x
36bits = 16mb simm & so on..

