Hi

I've got a version of the ava1505/1515 with jumpers (not isapnp)

then compile the MODULE aha152x.o from the standard unix-kernel.


the 1505 only has the 2 possible io's 140/340
and the irq 9-12

now do a
modprobe aha152x aha152x=340,10,7,1,1

340 = io
10   = irq
7     = host id of the adapter
1     = taqed comands I guess
1      = don't know

I don't know if this works with a non module version and boot params, but maybe you
can try.

Robert

