The original 433 miata was not designed as NT Only but as NT/Unix/VMS same
as the AS800, 1200, 4x00 and the 533 ultimate workstation . The 3000 5300
and 7300 are NT only(factory installed) $soft received money for each one
shipped..

The a/au were for tracking royalties, a's had NT Factory installed($soft),
au's had unix/vms ($soft received no royalties).

XL's were NT only, $soft received money for each one shipped. The problem
here is the XL never had an SRM "RELEASED" for it. That is being looked at
though, for linux-only installations with vms and unix support disabled.

 JJ
