>Fine OK I Use the ip as host name, but what do i use as queue name?

We use LPNG with Magicfilter.  The printer's host name is "printer1" and
the queue name seems to be "pcl".  The printer is an HP-LJ5mx.  Here's an
excerpt from our /etc/printcap:

pcl|HP_LaserJet:\
	:sd=/var/spool/lpd/lp\
	:mx#0:sh:\
	:if=/usr/local/bin/ljet4-filter\
	:bq=pcl@printer1:

