Edwin Koshimoto wrote:

> 
> When I reboot I get a lot of depmod and modprobe errors saying a lot of
> modules have unknown symbols.
> 

From what I have been able to determine in the past, 'make
modules_install' appends to an existing modules directory. When you
installed the new kernel for 6.1, it should have created a modules
directory for the new kernel. When you compiled another new kernel, it
may have appended the new modules to the current modules directory. Try
moving the old modules dir before the 'modules_install'.

