Hi Chris,

you got the command-prompt of the SRM-console. There are several commands you
can use here:

    show           shows all environment variables
    show devices   shows attached devices
    boot           boot from standard device
    boot dva0      ex: boots from floppy
    ... many other commands ....

There is also a 'help' command. Try it out. It works similar
to the VMS help (simply 'help <topic>' :). Btw: You can abbreviate all commands,
for example 'show devices' can also typed in as 'sh dev'.

Hope it helps

    Thomas







